# U-BOARD-1 rev B netlist, as exported from the CAD tool after the "cost-down" review.
# U-BOARD-1 is the university's teaching board: all parts and values are teaching values defined here,
# not a real product. Read with Figure 1 of F1-79.
board U-BOARD-1 rev B
supply +3V3 3.3
supply GND 0
# datasheet of the teaching MCU U-MCU-1: an I/O pin may source or sink at most 8 mA
limit pin_current 0.008
mcu U1
pin VDD1 +3V3
pin VDD2 +3V3
pin VSS1 GND
pin VSS2 GND
pin PA5 LED1_DRV
pin PB0 LED2_K
pin PC13 BTN1
# LED1: driven from PA5 through R1 to ground
resistor R1 33 LED1_DRV LED1_A
led D1 LED1_A GND 2.0 0.020
# LED2: from +3V3 through R3, cathode into PB0
resistor R3 470 +3V3 LED2_A
led D2 LED2_A LED2_K 2.0 0.020
# button to ground with a pull-up resistor
button SW1 BTN1 GND
resistor R2 10000 BTN1 +3V3
# decoupling capacitors, one per VDD pin
capacitor C1 100n +3V3 GND
capacitor C2 100n +3V3 GND
dnp R2
dnp C2
firmware_pull PC13 none
